{"unit_id":"zephaniahwang94-cmyk__dsh-auth-gate#card-zh","repo":"zephaniahwang94-cmyk/dsh-auth-gate","commit":"a9d08859c180febfe64d88c4c1972a0dfde71e25","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-auth-gate 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的认证与访问控制插件。它通过 Cordis patch 接入 webServer 和 approval 服务，为 HTTP 与 WebSocket 路由提供 Bearer 令牌或网页登录会话认证，并可为审批请求设置每分钟及每会话次数上限。插件还提供登录、退出页面和 Full、NetworkAuth、ApprovalLimit 三种预设，适合需要为 DSH Web 界面配置登录验证或限制审批频率的使用场景。按模式设置环境变量即可使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:37-55","src/http-auth.ts:22-32","src/approval-rate-limit.ts:27-99","cordis.patch.yml:12-38"]}
{"unit_id":"zephaniahwang94-cmyk__dsh-auth-gate#card-en","repo":"zephaniahwang94-cmyk/dsh-auth-gate","commit":"a9d08859c180febfe64d88c4c1972a0dfde71e25","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-auth-gate protects DSH web HTTP and WebSocket routes with bearer tokens or browser login sessions. It can also limit approval requests per minute and per session. The plugin includes login and logout pages and three presets for selecting network authentication and approval limits.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:37-55","src/http-auth.ts:22-32","src/approval-rate-limit.ts:27-99","cordis.patch.yml:12-38"]}
