{"unit_id":"zephaniahwang94-cmyk__dsh-auth-gate#feature-http","repo":"zephaniahwang94-cmyk/dsh-auth-gate","commit":"a9d08859c180febfe64d88c4c1972a0dfde71e25","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-auth-gate 的功能「HTTP 与 WebSocket 认证」：为已有及后续注册的 DSH 路由包装认证检查。可选择 Bearer token、网页登录会话或两者同时启用；未认证请求会被拒绝。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/http-auth.ts:22-64"]}
{"unit_id":"zephaniahwang94-cmyk__dsh-auth-gate#feature-login","repo":"zephaniahwang94-cmyk/dsh-auth-gate","commit":"a9d08859c180febfe64d88c4c1972a0dfde71e25","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-auth-gate 的功能「网页登录与退出」：在 session 或 both 模式提供登录页，验证用户名和密码后设置会话 Cookie，并提供退出路由撤销会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/http-auth.ts:105-150"]}
{"unit_id":"zephaniahwang94-cmyk__dsh-auth-gate#feature-rate","repo":"zephaniahwang94-cmyk/dsh-auth-gate","commit":"a9d08859c180febfe64d88c4c1972a0dfde71e25","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-auth-gate 的功能「审批频率限制」：监听 approval/request，按 DSH session 统计每分钟和会话累计请求数；超过配置上限或缺少 session id 时返回 unavailable。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/approval-rate-limit.ts:37-99"]}
{"unit_id":"zephaniahwang94-cmyk__dsh-auth-gate#feature-presets","repo":"zephaniahwang94-cmyk/dsh-auth-gate","commit":"a9d08859c180febfe64d88c4c1972a0dfde71e25","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-auth-gate 的功能「防护预设」：通过 Full、NetworkAuth 或 ApprovalLimit 预设选择启用网络认证和审批限流，并由安装器将选定 patch 注册到 DSH profile。","source":"generated","evidence":["install.sh:22-30"]}
{"unit_id":"zephaniahwang94-cmyk__dsh-auth-gate#caveat-env","repo":"zephaniahwang94-cmyk/dsh-auth-gate","commit":"a9d08859c180febfe64d88c4c1972a0dfde71e25","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-auth-gate 使用 session 登录时，从进程环境读取 DSH_AUTH_USERNAME 和 DSH_AUTH_PASSWORD；Bearer 模式需要至少 32 字节的令牌，session 密码至少 12 字节。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/config.ts:78-85"]}
{"unit_id":"zephaniahwang94-cmyk__dsh-auth-gate#caveat-restart","repo":"zephaniahwang94-cmyk/dsh-auth-gate","commit":"a9d08859c180febfe64d88c4c1972a0dfde71e25","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-auth-gate 的 session 签名密钥默认每次启动随机生成，因此重启后原有浏览器会话失效；配置不接受持久 sessionSecret。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/session.ts:23-25"]}
